    91	frequency requirement — symmetric margins). Report the full 2x2, both
    92	discordant fractions, union completeness, and incremental yields
    93	P(C=1,L=0), P(C=0,L=1) with intervals (Wilson for D3/D1; cluster bootstrap
    94	for D2). Exact McNemar is SECONDARY (marginal-homogeneity only; it does not
