   104	log P edges at P = {100 s, 200 s, 500 s, 1000 s, 2000 s, 0.05 d, 0.2 d,
   105	1 d, 10 d, 100 d}; amplitude edges {0.5, 1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 50, 200} mmag
   106	(D3) / {0.5, 2, 5, 10, 30, 100} ppt (D2); cells below 5 stars reported as
   107	counts only, no proportion.
   108	
