   110	
   111	Two denominators, both always reported: P(rule | eligible roster target) and
   112	P(rule | usable light curve) (frozen QC crossmatch passed, both passes
   113	available). A full attrition table (roster -> fetched -> crossmatched ->
   114	QC-passed -> both-passes-complete) by class, amplitude stratum, and
